2qrs80o"}},{"key":"gen_ai.tool.type","value":{"stringValue":"function"}},{"key":"gen_ai.tool.description","value":{"stringValue":"Use `read` for static web; browser only if needed.\n\nPut line ranges in `path`, never a separate range/offset/limit parameter: `{\"path\":\"notes.txt:450-455\"}` reads lines 450-455; `{\"path\":\"notes.txt:-5\"}` reads the last 5. Include the selector on every ranged call; repeating a bare path does not advance through the file.\n\nPath suffixes: :50 or :50- starts at line 50; :50-200 inclusive; :50+150 counts lines; :-60 last 60; commas join ranges (:5-16,960-973) or individual lines (:19,59). A single non-raw range also shows 1 line before and 3 after (e.g. :50-80 shows 49-83); non-raw reads (comma lists too) may add the open/close line of a cut block; only :raw stays exact. :raw verbatim without anchors/prefixes; combine :2-4:raw or :raw:2-4 for exactly those lines. :conflicts lists one line per unresolved merge block. SVG/SVGZ default text; :img rasterizes an SVG/SVGZ into an image, :raw original. Raster images (PNG, JPEG) need no selector; :img rejects them. Video requires ffmpeg/ffprobe: bare preview grid+metadata, :412 frame, :1h5m42s/:90s/:01:23 time.\n\nSources:\n- Bare code: declarations only; re-read ONLY footer-named omissions, NEVER guess `..`/`\u2026`.\n- Directory: complete root; child listings cap at 12 (`\u2026 N more`), read child; page via :N-M/:-N.\n- SQLite: file.db tables; :table schema/rows; :table:key by primary key; ?limit=, ?where=, ?q=SELECT.\n- Archives: ZIP/JAR/APK/WHL, compressed TAR, RAR/7z/ISO/CAB/DEB/RPM/CPIO/AR/LZH/ARJ/ASAR, compressed streams; member via archive.ext:member/path.\n- JSON/JSONL/NDJSON: file.json?q=<jq filter>; &raw=true unquoted strings, &compact=true one-line values, &offset=&limit= page results; `&` inside the filter \u2192 %26.\n- PDF/documents: extracted text; notebooks: editable cells; images: decoded inline. URLs: reader text/markdown, :raw original HTML; bare host:port needs trailing slash."}},{"key":"omp.gen_ai.tool.call.intent","value":{"stringValue":"Reading Launchpad comment syntax docs"}},{"key":"omp.gen_ai.tool.status","value":{"stringValue":"ok"}},{"key":"langfuse.trace.metadata.attempt_id","value":{"stringValue":"27c0d57bca6e442cbe3cb3bdd3992c84"}},{"key":"langfuse.trace.metadata.case_id","value":{"stringValue":"bb09b483f0f810b8f29a17a71b6a03959d90cbf8-pr645-review5164257458"}},{"key":"langfuse.trace.metadata.landed_commit","value":{"stringValue":"bb09b483f0f810b8f29a17a71b6a03959d90cbf8"}},{"key":"langfuse.trace.metadata.model","value":{"stringValue":"openrouter/deepseek/deepseek-v4-pro-0813"}},{"key":"langfuse.trace.metadata.repository","value":{"stringValue":"canonical/maas"}},{"key":"langfuse.trace.metadata.reviewed_commit","value":{"stringValue":"d5a9fcb13f30531c9603fe670b4b232550cd44bd"}},{"key":"langfuse.trace.metadata.run_id","value":{"stringValue":"maas-last3-20261025T211353Z"}},{"key":"langfuse.session.id","value":{"stringValue":"maas-last3-20261025T211353Z"}},{"key":"langfuse.trace.tags","value":{"arrayValue":{"values":[{"stringValue":"model-review-comparison"}]}}}],"status":{},"flags":257}]}]}]}
